# Only needed if you add a WalletConnect-based wallet to src/wagmi.ts.
# QoreX and injected browser wallets do not use it.
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# DEVELOPMENT ONLY. Put this in .env.local (git-ignored), never in .env.example.
# A THROWAWAY testnet recovery phrase for the QoreX test double, so native-lane
# steps can be tested on desktop. Never use a phrase that holds real funds.
# The production build refuses to run while it is set.
# VITE_QOREX_MOCK_MNEMONIC=

# DEMO SEED (scripts/seed-demo.ts): put this in .env.seed (git-ignored).
# A THROWAWAY testnet phrase only. The script refuses mainnet and accounts
# holding more than 50 QOR.
# SEED_MNEMONIC=

# END-TO-END CHECK (scripts/e2e-testnet.ts): also in .env.seed (git-ignored).
# Leave it unset: the first `pnpm e2e:testnet` makes a fresh throwaway account
# and writes its phrase here for you. Never put a phrase that holds real funds.
# E2E_MNEMONIC=
